worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_shell_compose.js"
  ceiling 408
  rationale "Browser twin of the issue #1177 shell-command composer. Mirrors `handle_shell_command_compose` in rust/src/solver_handlers/shell_command_compose.rs: action-verb and file-context cues come from data/seed/code-task-cues.lino, and every emitted flag is explained from the manual-page table in data/seed/manual-pages.lino. JavaScript-first twin of native handler keys (shell_command_compose), added under R997-R999 (2026-10-06); growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. R1017 (2026-10-07) +3: the composer steps aside when the text-manipulation handler reads a seeded text operation over an inline payload, twin of the Rust `names_text_operation` guard. Ceiling 408 (R1017): a relative path such as data/meta is the search root, mirroring root_path."
